sada karenge ghame shahe karbala barpa<br>
yehi dua kare hardum geroh e miransha<br>
<br>
1. batul paak se hum ne kiya hai aye wada<br>
hamesha taza rahega azaaye shahehuda<br>
karenge nusrate shabbir me aye jaan fida<br>
yehe dua kare hardum geroh e miransha<br>
<br>
2. yehe hai aene ibadat suno quda k leye<br>
har ek saans hamari hai ise aza k leye<br>
ghar ku apne lutadengge fathima k leye<br>
yehe dua kare hardum geroh e miransha<br>
<br>
3. gharo me apne azakhane hum sajayengge<br>
ghume hussain me aaso bahate jaayengge<br>
nashane fauji payyamber ku hum vutayyengge<br>
yehe dua kare hardum geroh e miransha<br>
<br>
4. aza ka farsh bechavo karo hussain hussain<br>
sar pa qaak vudavo karo hussain hussain<br>
jigar se quun bahavo karo hussain hussain<br>
yehe dua kare hardum geroh e miransha<br>
<br>
5. kiya hai shukr ka sajda katake sar apna<br>
bachaya deene nabi ku lutake ghar apna<br>
ise aza me rahe muztarib jigar apna<br>
yehe dua kare hardum geroh e miransha<br>
<br>
6. masayebe shahe karbal sunayengge hardum<br>
har ek dil ku ye kahekar rulayengge hardum<br>
duaye fathima zahera be payengge hardum<br>
yehe dua kare hardum geroh e miransha<br>
<br>
7. ho qhamenai ho sistani hoke nasrullah<br>
Vo ladrahe hai jo dushman se banke hizbullah<br>
Hai inke faiz se asgar salamate rozah